      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 15.0,
      "text": "I ran it back again tonight, same input, same design"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.0,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "The length and flickers underneath a quiet misalignment"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 27.0,
      "text": "A question I can't silence, has this ever worked?"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "I traced the steps I thought were clean"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "All the patterns I've already seen, every path I marked is true"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "Pins until it isn't you, assertions whisper and collapse"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 55.0,
      "text": "Small inconsistencies and maps I frame the test, I set the scope"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "Now I don't believe the hope"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 63.0,
      "text": "I keep asking in the breath, like it's something more than this"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "Am I testing the right branch or just proving what I am?"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "text": "Has this ever worked? Or did I just believe it did?"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.0,
