      "text": "Every check I run and just returns me to the first"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.0,
      "end": 96.0,
      "text": "In case it's drifting to the frame, uninvited still the same conditions"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "I refuse to meet, now they're walking through my sleep"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 106.0,
      "text": "Coverage says I'm almost there, but there's something I don't share"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "A passing stick that feels too thin, like I feel the dirt out the risk with"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 119.0,
      "text": "And I simulate what I can see, ignore the deeper dependency"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.0,
      "end": 124.0,
      "text": "Every failure I dismiss, reappears inside the list"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.0,
      "end": 129.0,
      "text": "Has this ever worked? Or did I just avoid the truth?"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "Did I build a frame? Or out of everything I knew?"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 140.0,
      "text": "Am I testing past that I'm too afraid to take?"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.0,
      "end": 146.0,
      "text": "Every line I skip is another quiet break"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.0,
      "end": 154.0,
      "text": "I'm not testing the right branch or just returning me to the frame"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.0,
      "end": 159.0,
      "text": "I'm not testing the right branch or just returning me to the frame"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.0,
      "end": 170.0,
      "text": "Patterns echo until they're known, signal surface on their own"
