    {
      "start": 170.0,
      "end": 181.0,
      "text": "Not every flaw is there to hide some survive to realize"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.0,
      "end": 187.0,
      "text": "So I let the failures take their place, read them like a trace, not a mistake"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.0,
      "end": 192.0,
      "text": "Stop defending every pass, start it, see in what might last"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.0,
      "end": 196.0,
      "text": "There's aversion, our resist living just be on the list, not incorrect"
    },
    {
      "start": 196.0,
      "end": 201.0,
      "text": "And the fine waiting with the edges behind, maybe testing isn't proof"
    },
    {
      "start": 201.0,
      "end": 208.0,
      "text": "Maybe it's a way to move through uncertainty with care"
    },
    {
      "start": 208.0,
      "end": 214.0,
      "text": "And still, barkting like it's clean"
    },
    {
      "start": 214.0,
      "end": 219.0,
